ollowing message once the stream is shifted\\\"],\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The observation is worth retaining even without the formal check, and the validator constraint is recorded precisely so the next attempt frames it correctly instead of iterating blindly. The default deployment is inside the field's range, so the finding's importance is bounded to configurations whose command size exceeds 65535 bytes.\\\",\n \\\"understanding\\\":\\\"updated\\\",\\\"question_updates\\\":{}}\nsub={\\\"action\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Records a new locally reproduced finding (the command value length is truncated on the wire for values beyond the two-byte field) plus the exact framing constraint that blocked filing it as a check this turn. Adds the codec and configuration sources; no map object changes.\\\",\n \\\"sources\\\":srcs,\\\"feedback\\\":fb}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-note-value-codec.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd .. && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-note-value-codec.json 2>&1 | head -8\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
